  m_text: "Lastly, at the end of the case files you will find the accusation page.
    Here you must write down your final verdict about who really commited the murder.
    This will be the single suspect who has the following three things: no alibi,
    a motive to commit the crime, and access to the murder weapon. \nBEWARE: Some
    suspects may be trying to hide something despite not being guilty of the crime."
